# Operational output of the ingest loop, rewritten every 3 minutes. Committing
# it would put 200 KB of churn in every cycle and would make the VPS's
# `git pull --ff-only` fight its own running loop.
state/

# Credentials for keepalive.sh (the OMS billing pair). Already matched by the
# repo-root *.env rule; repeated here so it is obvious next to the script.
.keepalive.env
